      "writtenOn": "2021-01-05T01:37:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I was hoping to keep it generic enough so that it could be used for other purposes, since we already have a ton of phony targets.\n\nOther interesting files:\nDependencies outside the ec root dir (../../third_party/cryptoc/*), intermediate targets like  objects and build/*/firmware_image.lds, and odd files like *.tasklist.\n\n---\n\nMaybe this is too generic for others to understand?",
      "parentUuid": "5dd1f4df_f9889c81",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 725,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 725,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "5da97e048a9802ebc6c4e6680db999cd1d60bd2b",
