      "lineNbr": 725,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-06T22:52:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that printing all source files (including .tasklist and third_party/cryptoc) is what I would expect it to do by default. I\u0027m having a hard time visualizing what the generated object file names would be used for (i.e., anything in the build dir). Did you have something in mind? If not, maybe make the default to exclude the build dir and have another command \"print-depends-all\" (or whatever) for the generic case. Or one could be \"print-sources\" and the other \"print-depends\".",
      "parentUuid": "8694b06a_4efe06d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 725,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 725,
        "endChar": 39
