      "writtenOn": "2021-01-05T01:37:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, but then the extra build output could confuse/contaminate the stdout/stderr. Even more so run with boards that have broken make rules that always force a rebuild (like bloonchipper before crrev.com/c/2593881).\n\nYes, I could force all the build output to stderr, like I did above, but I was still worried that might be confusing.\n\n---\n\nI would like this to be easy for others to understand and use, sooo I am very open to changes that make this easy for others to understand.",
